<title>INDIA: Indo Gulf Fert puts off board meet.</title>
<headline>Indo Gulf Fert puts off board meet.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Indo Gulf Fertilisers and Chemicals Corporation Ltd has postponed a scheduled board meeting to April 29 from April 22 to consider dividend for the year ended March 31, 1997, the firm said in a statement to the Bombay Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>It did not give any reason.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
